    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444830/extras/4c94df435b4d258d69ed7c66fc60d418.avif?t=1755303703\" width=616 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wizard Hand is a magical solitaire roguelike about accumulating the maximum number of magical points by mastering the art of combining enchanted cards, transformations, and a collection of magical items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444830/extras/eff0a3e379462d0b4adc338940a90f46.poster.avif?t=1755303703\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444830/extras/eff0a3e379462d0b4adc338940a90f46.webm?t=1755303703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444830/extras/eff0a3e379462d0b4adc338940a90f46.mp4?t=1755303703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal of the game is to remove the entire pyramid of cards from the table, while scoring the maximum points. Play a matching card onto the pyramid card to start a combo!\u00a0The more points you have, the more opportunities you have to expand your magical arsenal and be ready for future challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444830/extras/914a9e634174b561653dc1ed2c68c566.poster.avif?t=1755303703\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444830/extras/914a9e634174b561653dc1ed2c68c566.webm?t=1755303703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444830/extras/914a9e634174b561653dc1ed2c68c566.mp4?t=1755303703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444830/extras/5803b0837a4a216898d5921b3e222aec.avif?t=1755303703\" width=616 height=84 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Artifacts that multiply points and have a lot of useful effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crystals containing crafting recipes allow you to temporarily transform one card into another</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters with their strengths and weaknesses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pyramid guardians using their power to stop you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bosses - force you to take an unconventional approach to the entire round</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enchanted cards - build your own magic deck\u00a0and use cards in an unusual way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Card upgrades - every card in your deck can be made stronger</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streak mechanic - the bonuses increase with each combination in a row</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replayability -\u00a0unlock new artifacts, characters and additional starting rules as you play</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444830/extras/ac6d4b216813c99f025b10798c93fa26.poster.avif?t=1755303703\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444830/extras/ac6d4b216813c99f025b10798c93fa26.webm?t=1755303703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444830/extras/ac6d4b216813c99f025b10798c93fa26.mp4?t=1755303703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444830/extras/c813f70600c638c405d4f218393b16f3.avif?t=1755303703\" width=616 height=77 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play a matching card onto the pyramid card to start a combo!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more similar the cards are to each other, the more initial points the player will receive for the combo. Then use all your magical tools to get as many points as you can for the combo you're playing! And don't hold back - the bonuses increase with each combination in a row.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unleash the full potential of your cards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each card can be used in various amount of combos, transformed into another, or serve as host for powerful enchantments. And don't hesitate to upgrade the rank of your cards to unlock their full potential!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expand your deck with a vast variety of enchanted cards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your deck with a vast variety of enchanted cards. Use those magic abilities to adapt the pyramid to your needs. Change the cards in the pyramid or in your hand as you see fit, avoiding the guard spells and discovering other ways to use enchantments. You\u2019re going to need every edge you can get in order to secure victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444830/extras/93e732ba7826f8518deee1febf58c0fa.poster.avif?t=1755303703\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444830/extras/93e732ba7826f8518deee1febf58c0fa.webm?t=1755303703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444830/extras/93e732ba7826f8518deee1febf58c0fa.mp4?t=1755303703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Adapt and overcome the ever-changing challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each level of the pyramid, guardians with unique traits will appear, requiring an unconventional approach. Don't underestimate their defensive abilities, they can cause a lot of havoc on the field and mess up your plans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444830/extras/2f19ce088165369401186b0ed9496c50.poster.avif?t=1755303703\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444830/extras/2f19ce088165369401186b0ed9496c50.webm?t=1755303703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444830/extras/2f19ce088165369401186b0ed9496c50.mp4?t=1755303703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But with a well-thought-out strategy, Guardians can even work in your favor.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the ultimate collection of powerful artifact</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect your ultimate collection of powerful artifacts. Each one of them will change the way you play the game. Choose them carefully to create your unique build. Figure out how they all work together with each other and with the rest of the game's mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444830/extras/c7c84f96d21b2680491eaadc1aa5afbf.poster.avif?t=1755303703\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444830/extras/c7c84f96d21b2680491eaadc1aa5afbf.webm?t=1755303703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444830/extras/c7c84f96d21b2680491eaadc1aa5afbf.mp4?t=1755303703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose the best crafting recipes that suit your gaming style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting recipes sealed in magic crystals allows you to change cards in your hand right during the middle of a game round, giving you unique flexibility when deciding on your next move. No matching card in your hand and not enough of the right kind of enchantment? No problem, just use the cards you have as ingredients to create the ones you need. And don't be afraid to experiment, because at the end of the round, all the created cards will return to their original form.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444830/extras/df9012ff26d8dd5511e5ac2f7f1cf801.poster.avif?t=1755303703\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444830/extras/df9012ff26d8dd5511e5ac2f7f1cf801.webm?t=1755303703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444830/extras/df9012ff26d8dd5511e5ac2f7f1cf801.mp4?t=1755303703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new possibilities with each playthrough. Plan the most powerful and lengthy combos, using your magical deck to its fullest potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444830/extras/4c94df435b4d258d69ed7c66fc60d418.avif?t=1755303703\" width=616 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wizard Hand is a magical solitaire roguelike about accumulating the maximum number of magical points by mastering the art of combining enchanted cards, transformations, and a collection of magical items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444830/extras/eff0a3e379462d0b4adc338940a90f46.poster.avif?t=1755303703\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444830/extras/eff0a3e379462d0b4adc338940a90f46.webm?t=1755303703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444830/extras/eff0a3e379462d0b4adc338940a90f46.mp4?t=1755303703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal of the game is to remove the entire pyramid of cards from the table, while scoring the maximum points. Play a matching card onto the pyramid card to start a combo!\u00a0The more points you have, the more opportunities you have to expand your magical arsenal and be ready for future challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444830/extras/914a9e634174b561653dc1ed2c68c566.poster.avif?t=1755303703\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444830/extras/914a9e634174b561653dc1ed2c68c566.webm?t=1755303703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstati